# THE GESTURE RECORDER, 0.17.44: an effect played is written too, and with AUTO FX's Pick on YOURS the gesture is kept for AUTO FX, which plays
# it once on its phrase lines (here every 4 bars) and lets go. Wild, every 4 bars, Pick YOURS on the AUTO FX page.
seed 0
seamless 1
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 34
spin K1 3
spin K2 -1
spin K4 2
wait 100
expect fxs92 3
expect fxs93 0
expect fxs95 2
tap FX
wait 500
expect view 0
expect playing 1
# arm it, then the roll (key 15) starts the writing
tap FX
wait 100
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
expect gesture 1
wait 1500
expect gesture 1
key 15 down
wait 100
expect gesture 2
wait 900
key 15 up
wait 100
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
waitfor gesture 4 8000
expect gsfx >3
expect gslen >15
# out of the FX menu: AUTO FX plays it (whole bars, ending on a line), the roll included, and lets go
tap FX
wait 300
waitfor gsshot 1 40000
expect affx 255
waitfor fxbit22 1 4000
waitfor gsshot 0 12000
expect gesture 4
expect fxbit22 0
